// `...` (list spread) requires a list operand. Spreading a concrete non-list is a static error
// rather than silently falling through `~` to display-concatenation. `...x` is a runtime-identity
// marker the L2 desugar wraps spread operands in; the checker enforces the list requirement.
// expect: error E0007 at 6:10
// expect: exit 1
echo [...42];
